      "locator": "2 Method / factorized loss and Memory-efficient implementation",
      "excerpt": "we sequentially compute the forward and backward pass of each independent output head",
      "formula_excerpts": [
        "L_{n}=-\\sum_{t}\\log P_{\\theta}(x_{t+n:t+1}\\mid x_{t:1}).",
        "P_{\\theta}(x_{t+i}\\mid x_{t:1})=\\text{softmax}(f_{u}(f_{h_{i}}(f_{s}(x_{t:1})))),"
      ],
      "inspection_note": "已讀 Method 的交叉熵、共用核心與獨立分支公式，以及逐分支累積核心梯度的實作段落。目標對各位置和未來距離加總；沒有本例逐分支有效目標平均與 0.5 的固定配方。"
    },
    {
