      "locator": "2.2 Multi-Token Prediction / MTP Training Objective",
      "excerpt": "Finally, we compute the average of the MTP losses across all depths",
      "formula_excerpts": [
        "\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MTP}}^{k}=\\operatorname{CrossEntropy}(P_{2+k:T+1}^{k},t_{2+k:T+1})=-\\frac{1}{T}\\sum_{i=2+k}^{T+1}\\log P_{i}^{k}[t_{i}],",
        "\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MTP}}=\\frac{\\lambda}{D}\\sum_{k=1}^{D}\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{MTP}}^{k}."
      ],
      "inspection_note": "已讀 Multi-Token Prediction 的模組與訓練目標。模組 k 的預測是額外的第 k 個未來 token，即距離 k+1；代價除以 T，接著以 lambda/D 加總深度，不等於本例各自除以有效目標數。"
    },
